      ******************************************************************
      * copy/CREPOS.cpy -- REPOSITORY members of the CMPXLBRY library.
      *
      * COPY this inside the REPOSITORY paragraph to make every library
      * function name available to a program:
      *
      *       REPOSITORY.
      *       COPY CREPOS.
      *
      * An application that needs only a subset may instead list those
      * FUNCTION entries by hand rather than copying this member.
      ******************************************************************
           FUNCTION COMPLEX-ADD
           FUNCTION COMPLEX-SUB
           FUNCTION COMPLEX-MULT
           FUNCTION COMPLEX-DIVIDE
           FUNCTION COMPLEX-INVERSE
           FUNCTION COMPLEX-SCALE
           FUNCTION COMPLEX-NEGATE
           FUNCTION COMPLEX-CONJUGATE
           FUNCTION COMPLEX-REAL
           FUNCTION COMPLEX-IMAG
           FUNCTION COMPLEX-FORMAT.
      ******************************************************************
